{"version":1,"content":"<p>史丹福大學一名機械工程學生通過拆解並測試多款頂級競速跑鞋，揭示了「超級跑鞋」為何能夠幫助運動員提升成績。研究顯示，鞋底專用泡沫材料在緩衝、回彈和穩定性方面的表現，可能比碳纖維板更關鍵。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587350.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.065136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:22:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"21e44a849728d8aff468d3b8b4530caa24edd53bf81c94bf441d4e3081b6619d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}